#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "空闲"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid "A plugin for idle settings, such as the screensaver and DPMS."
msgstr "用于空闲设置（例如屏幕保护和 DPMS）的插件。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Toggle"
msgstr "切换"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Disables the compositor going idle with the specified activator. Pressing "
"again reactivates."
msgstr "使用指定激活器禁用合成器进入空闲状态。再次按下可重新启用。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Screensaver timeout"
msgstr "屏幕保护超时"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Displays the screensaver after the specified seconds of inactivity. Setting "
"the value to **-1** disables the screensaver."
msgstr "在无操作达到指定秒数后显示屏幕保护程序。值为 **-1** 时禁用屏幕保护。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "DPMS timeout"
msgstr "DPMS 超时"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Enters power saving mode after the specified seconds of inactivity. Setting "
"the value to **-1** disables power saving."
msgstr "在无操作达到指定秒数后进入省电模式。值为 **-1** 时禁用省电模式。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Disable on fullscreen"
msgstr "全屏时禁用"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Disables idle on fullscreen."
msgstr "全屏时禁用空闲检测。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Disable idle timeout initially"
msgstr "初始禁用空闲超时"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Disables idle timeout innitially as if the toggle was called once after "
"loading the plugin."
msgstr "初始时禁用空闲超时，等同于加载插件后调用一次切换。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Cube zoom speed"
msgstr "立方体缩放速度"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Sets the zoom speed. The speed means how long it will take from the time the "
"screensaver starts to the time the cube reaches `idle.cube_max_zoom`."
msgstr "设置缩放速度。该速度表示从屏幕保护开始到立方体达到 `idle.cube_max_zoom` 所需的时间。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Cube rotate speed"
msgstr "立方体旋转速度"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Sets the speed rotation of the cube."
msgstr "设置立方体的旋转速度。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Cube max zoom"
msgstr "立方体最大缩放"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid "Sets the maximum zoom level."
msgstr "设置最大缩放级别。"
